SUMMARY:The Metropolitan Opera: Macbeth
DESCRIPTION:The Metropolitan Opera: Macbeth\n(4.1)\n\n𝟯𝗵𝟯𝟬\n\nU
 S\n(Italian\, English)\n\n𝗥𝗲𝗮𝗹𝗶𝘀𝗮𝘁𝗲𝘂𝗿𝘀
  : Louisa Proske\, Gary Halvorson\n𝗦𝗰𝗲𝗻𝗮𝗿𝗶𝗼 : Fran
 cesco Maria Piave\, Andrea Maffei\n\n𝗔𝗰𝘁𝗲𝘂𝗿𝘀 :\n- Lis
 e Davidsen\n- Quinn Kelsey\n- Jonathan Burton\n- Freddie De Tommaso\n- Rya
 n Speedo Green\n- Anthony Roth Costanzo\n\n\n(synopsis non encore traduit 
 sur TMDB)\nTwo of opera’s most extraordinary artists return to The Met: 
 Live in HD for Verdi’s thrilling take on the immortal Shakespearean tale
  of the scheming couple determined to seize power at any cost. Following p
 ast triumphs in many of Verdi’s signature baritone roles\, Quinn Kelsey 
 is the Scottish king haunted by the ghosts of his murderous ascent to the 
 throne\, opposite Lise Davidsen—the world’s reigning dramatic soprano
 —as the power-mad Lady Macbeth\, whose ruinous ambition damns them both.
  Met Music Director Yannick Nézet-Séguin takes the podium for a penetrat
 ing production by Louisa Proske\, a brilliant young director making waves 
 around the world. Rounding out the all-star cast are tenor Freddie De Tomm
 aso as the heroic Macduff and bass-baritone Ryan Speedo Green as Macbeth
 ’s friend-turned-victim Banquo. This live cinema transmission is part of
  The Met: Live in HD series\, bringing opera to movie theaters across the 
 globe.\n\n\nAffiche : https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5Z1rpLnrxn8LAMtDZKCf
 YlcPeYa.jpg\n\nFiche TMDB : https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1703622\n\nDo
 nnées fournies par The Movie Database (TMDB)
