SUMMARY:GDL
DESCRIPTION:GDL\n(3.6)\n\nDrame\, Comédie\n𝟯𝗵𝟯𝟲\n\nMexico\, Un
 ited States of America\n(Spanish)\n\n𝗣𝗵𝗼𝘁𝗼𝗴𝗿𝗮𝗽
 𝗵𝗶𝗲 : Santiago Neto\n𝗣𝗿𝗼𝗱𝘂𝗰𝘁𝗶𝗼𝗻 : U
 niversidad Autónoma de Guadalajara\, Liza\, Liza\, C.P.A.\n\n𝗔𝗰𝘁
 𝗲𝘂𝗿𝘀 :\n- Virgilio Delgado\n- Sasha González\n- Sebastian Agu
 irre Boëda\n- Ximena Lamadrid\n- Juan Pablo de Santiago\n- Diego Cortina 
 Autrey\n- Jorge Antonio Guerrero\n- Nicolás Amelio-Ortiz\n- María Aura\n
 - Alejandro Puente\n- Ricardo Montez\n- Ana López Mercado\n\n\n(synopsis 
 non encore traduit sur TMDB)\nGDL is a Mexican dark comedy-drama film set 
 in Guadalajara. We meet Daniel Lurdez\, a young man who\, after arriving i
 n the city\, ends up in a psychologist’s office. Seeing that he is clear
 ly struggling\, she asks him\, “Why do you feel like you feel this way?
 ” Daniel begins to tell his story\, and through his memories\, we experi
 ence his first year in Guadalajara: the people he met\, his relationships\
 , parties\, hopes\, disappointments\, and failures. Throughout this year\,
  we discover a gigantic\, contradictory\, and vibrant city\; a monster tha
 t slowly transforms everyone who arrives. Guadalajara promises opportuniti
 es and a new life\, but it can also destroy the dreams of those trying to 
 find their place in it. Daniel arrived looking to become someone different
 . In the end\, the city turned him into someone he never imagined he would
  become. GODS\, DEVILS AND LIARS.\n\n\nAffiche : https://image.tmdb.org/t/
 p/w780/rrQ8zxW8pFwh6VuDMdGc4MuMHBy.jpg\n\nFiche TMDB : https://www.themovi
 edb.org/movie/1747292\n\nDonnées fournies par The Movie Database (TMDB)
